  "query_preview": "..\n(Thursday through next Tuesday)\nIssued at 1023 PM CDT Mon May 11 2026\n\nThe second shot will come this weekend, but it just isn't much. The \nlatest GFS and Euro solutions are in a little better extended \nguidance agreement tonight with both trying to squeeze out a shower \nor storm Friday night with no additional rain chances until the \nmiddle of next week. Yeah. Not great. Then, the icing on the cake: \nbetter agreement is also being shown on temperatures this weekend\nreaching the low 90s. We have not hit 90 at BNA yet this year, but\nit does look like it's on its way as weak ridging behind Friday\nnight's tiny precip chances exerts itself on the region. The last\ntime we saw 90? Sept 21st, 2025. Summer's acomin'.",
